### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "securePass123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("token", "Bearer " + response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 카테고리 등록
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/category
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "기타"
}

### 카테고리 조회
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/category
Authorization: {{token}}

### 카테고리 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/category/12
Authorization: {{token}}
